      "source": "https://lakelorelei.com/history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The lake community spans 22 miles of roads, winding through its 197‑acre waterway and surrounding residential lots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
